'''Team Work Makes the Dream Work''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to have everyone get through the attack without taking damage when [[Verzik Vitur]], in the [[Theatre of Blood: Hard Mode]], uses her yellow power blast attack while the tornadoes are active. This cannot be completed with one player alive.

